{"product_id":"amethyst-royale-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Ebony wood x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003e Crafted from\u003cstrong\u003e Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, the forearm showcases striking \u003cstrong\u003eebony points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented by vibrant \u003cstrong\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e and meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating exceptional depth, contrast, and visual elegance. A lustrous \u003cstrong\u003eamethyst resin coating\u003c\/strong\u003e enhances the natural beauty of the design with a rich, high-gloss finish, while the \u003cstrong\u003epremium Black Luxe wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e provides a secure, comfortable grip and a refined playing experience.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eebony butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, adorned with matching handcrafted abalone inlays, completes the cue with perfect harmony and sophistication. Designed for discerning players and collectors, the Amethyst Royale reflects the precision, artistry, and uncompromising craftsmanship that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft for play or displayed as a centerpiece in a premium collection, this cue is built to impress from every angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Ebony Points, Multi-Colored Veneers \u0026amp; Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCoatin